3. THIRD-PARTY DATA  (not covered by either license above)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

The following are redistributed from public releases by other authors and
remain under whatever terms those authors set. Nothing in this file grants
any rights over them.

  analysis/data/raw/debategpt.csv
      From the public release accompanying Salvi, Horta Ribeiro, Gallotti and
      West, "On the conversational persuasiveness of GPT-4", Nature Human
      Behaviour 9(8):1645-1653 (2025).

  analysis/data/scaling-conversational-AI/
      From the public release accompanying Hackenburg et al., "The levers of
      political persuasion with conversational artificial intelligence",
      Science 390(6777):eaea3884 (2025).
      https://github.com/kobihackenburg/scaling-conversational-AI
      Only the three derived data files this project's pipeline reads are
      included; see analysis/data/fetch_upstream.sh for the full release.
      The upstream authors state that raw conversation logs contain
      personally identifiable information and are not publicly available.
      No such logs are present here.

Model outputs in analysis/data/requery_*.jsonl were generated by this project
from open-weights models (Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct, Mistral-7B-Instruct-v0.3,
Phi-3.5-mini-instruct) and are provided under CC BY 4.0 as derived results,
subject to those models' own licenses for any downstream use.
